site_name: LeetCode 演算法精鍊筆記
site_description: LeetCode 解題筆記與演算法整理 (C++)
repo_url: https://github.com/smartcsie/leetcode
repo_name: smartcsie/leetcode

theme:
  name: material
  language: zh-TW
  features:
    - navigation.tabs
    - navigation.top
    - navigation.instant
    - toc.integrate
    - content.code.copy
    - search.suggest
    - search.highlight
  palette:
    - scheme: default
      primary: indigo
      toggle:
        icon: material/brightness-7
        name: 切換至深色模式
    - scheme: slate
      primary: indigo
      toggle:
        icon: material/brightness-4
        name: 切換至淺色模式

markdown_extensions:
  - pymdownx.highlight:
      anchor_linenums: true
  - pymdownx.superfences
  - pymdownx.tabbed:
      alternate_style: true
  - admonition
  - pymdownx.details
  - toc:
      permalink: true
  - tables
  - attr_list

nav:
  - 首頁: index.md
  - 📄 Other:
      - 🤖 Solutions: solutions.md
      - 🤖 Algorithm(Leetcode): algorithmleetcode.md
      - 🤖 Resource: resource.md
      - 🤖 電子書: 電子書.md
      - 🤖 面試考題: 面試考題.md
      - 🤖 重要: 重要.md
      - 🚀 快速導覽: 快速導覽.md
  - 🔢 Math:
      - 🔢 Math (數學): math.md
      - 🔢 Math Combination(數學 組合): math-combination.md
      - 🔢 Math Permutation(數學 排列): math-permutation.md
      - 🔢 Math - Factor Enumeration(數學 因式分解): math-factor-enumeration.md
      - 🔢 Math - Simulation (數學模擬): math-simulation.md
      - 🔢 Math- Digit Decomposition(數學 數字拆解): math-digit-decomposition.md
      - 🔢 Math Prime(數學 質數): prime.md
      - 🔢 Math Palindrome(數學-回文): math-palindrome.md
  - 📊 Bit Manipulation:
      - 📊 Bit Manipulation (位元運算): bit-manipulation.md
      - 📊 Bit Manipulation - Mask (位元運算 - 遮罩): bit-manipulation-mask.md
      - 📊 Bit Manipulation - OR operation (位元運算 - 或運算): bit-manipulation-or.md
      - 📊 Bit Manipulation - AND operation (位元運算 - 及運算): bit-manipulation-and.md
      - 📊 Bit Manipulation - XOR operation (位元運算 - 互斥或運算): bit-manipulation-xor.md
      - 📊 Bit Manipulation - Hamming Distance (位元運算 漢明距離): hamming-distance.md
      - 📊 Bit Manipulation - Bitmask Subset Enumeration (位元運算 - 遮罩子集合列舉): bit-bitmask-subset-enumeration.md
  - 🔗 String:
      - 🔗 String (字串): string.md
      - 🔗 String - State Machine (字串 有限狀態機): string-state-machine.md
      - 🔗 String - Substring Enumeration (字串 子字串列舉): string-substring-enumeration.md
      - 🔗 String - Character Classification (字串 字元識別): string-character-classification.md
      - 🔗 String - Character (字串 統計字元): string-substring.md
      - 🔗 String - Substring (字串 子字串): string-substring-2.md
      - 🔗 String - Knuth Morris Pratt (字串 KMP): string-kmp.md
  - 🍱 Array:
      - 🍱 Array (陣列): array.md
      - 🍱 Array - Continuous Counting (陣列 連續計數): array-continuous-counting.md
      - 🍱 Array - Dual Counter Switch (陣列 雙計數切換): array-continuous-counting-2.md
      - 🍱 Array - Linear Scan (陣列 線性掃描): array-linear-scan.md
      - 🍱 Array - Difference Array (陣列 差分陣列): array-difference-array.md
      - 🍱 Array - Boyer-Moore Voting Algorithm(陣列 多數投票演算法): array-boyer-moore.md
      - 🍱 Array - 2D Array (陣列 二維陣列): 2d-array.md
  - 🔍 Binary Search:
      - 🔍 Binary Search (二分查找): binary-search.md
      - 🔍 Binary Search Build in Function (內建函數二分查找): binary-search-build-in.md
      - 🌳 Binary Search Tree (二元搜尋樹): binary-search-tree.md
  - 🗓️ Interval:
      - 🗓️ Interval (區間): interval.md
  - 🔍 Prefix Sum:
      - 🔍 Prefix Sum (前綴和): prefix-sum.md
  - ⛓️ Linked List:
      - ⛓️ Linked List (鏈表): linked-list.md
      - ⛓️ Linked List - Circular / Cycle Management (環狀處理): linked-list-circular.md
  - 👥 Pointers:
      - 👥 Fast-Slow Pointers (快慢指針): fast-slow-pointers.md
      - 👥 Two Pointers - Opposite Direction (對撞型): two-pointers-opposite.md
      - 👥 Two Pointers - Same Direction (同向型): two-pointers-same.md
      - 👥 Two Pointers - Partition (分割型): two-pointers-partition.md
      - 👥 Two Pointers - Swap (交換型): two-pointers-swap.md
      - 👥 Two Pointers - Center Expansion (中心擴展型): two-pointers-center-expansion.md
      - 👥 Two Pointers - Other (變形型): two-pointers-other.md
  - 🔑 Hash Table:
      - 🔑 Hash Table - Counting (頻率統計): hash-table-counting.md
      - 🔑 Hash Table - Mapping (映射 / 異位詞 / 同構): hash-table-mapping.md
      - 🔑 Hash Table - Set (集合 / 存在性判斷): hash-table-set.md
  - 📚 Stack:
      - 📚 Stack (堆疊): stack.md
      - 📚 Monotonic Stack (單調堆疊): monotonic-stack.md
      - 📚 Monotonic Queue (單調柱列): monotonic-queue.md
      - 📚 Priority Queue (優先佇列): priority-queue.md
      - 📚 Quick Select(快速選擇): quick-select.md
  - 🌳 Tree:
      - 🌳 Tree (樹結構): tree.md
      - 🌳 Tree - BFS / Level Order (層序遍歷): tree-bfs-level-order.md
      - 🌳 Tree - DFS / Path (深度優先 / 路徑): tree-dfs-path.md
      - 🔗 Trie (前綴樹): trie.md
      - 🌳 DFS、BFS (深度搜尋、廣度搜尋): dfs-bfs.md
  - 📊 Sorting:
      - 📊 Sorting (排序): sorting.md
      - 📊 Sorting - Cycle Decomposition(排序 循環分解): sorting-cycle-decomposition.md
      - 📊 Sorting - Counting Sort , Radix Sort , Bucket Sort (排序): sorting-2.md
  - 🧩 Dynamic Programming:
      - 🧩 Dynamic Programming (動態規劃): dynamic-programming.md
      - 🧩 Dynamic Programming - House Robber (打家劫舍): dynamic-programming-2.md
      - 🧩 Dynamic Programming - Stock (股票): dynamic-programming-3.md
      - 🧩 Dynamic Programming - LCS (最長共同子序列): dynamic-programming-4.md
      - 🧩 Dynamic Programming - 0/1 Knapsack Problem  (0/1背包問題): knapsack-problem.md
      - 🧩 Dynamic Programming - Unbounded Knapsack Problem (無限大小背包問題): knapsack-problem-2.md
      - 🧩 Dynamic Programming - Kadane's Algorithm(動態規劃): dynamic-programming-kadane-algorithm.md
  - 🧩 Greedy:
